      "content": "i've tried all that. the groups, the being \"patient\"... it's just a cycle of nothing. it feels like i'm just taking up space and using up resources that don't even matter. if i just quietly exited everything, would it even leave a dent? like, if a ghost finally disappears, does anyone even notice the silence?",
